+     (web.c:6202) and issues "restart_wan_if <unit>"; start_wan_if() then returns at
+     its wanN_enable check (rc/wan.c:1351), so the state is persistent, not a
+     session-only disconnect. -->
+<form method="post" name="wanForm" id="wanForm" action="/start_apply.htm" target="hidden_frame" style="display:none">
